                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#F3EEE4",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "48.5% of people with a bachelor's degree or higher earn above $50K, compared with 13.0% with high school or less.",
