                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#F3EEE4",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "executive and professional jobs have the highest rates, and the rate climbs with hours up to 50 to 59 a week.",
